2pt\">■&nbsp;응모기간 : 2014. 3. 27 ~ 4. 30</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">■</span> 응모자격 : 국민 누구나(제한 없음)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">■</span> 응모분야 : 주제 및 콘텐츠</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 67.16pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 24.14pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">구 분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 372.8pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 24.14pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">참 고 사 항</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt dotted; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 67.16pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 82.83pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□</span>주 제</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt dotted; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LE